      "en": "Intellectual friendship with Xavier Léon and the circles of the *Revue de métaphysique* offered me a first philosophical anchor: the early death of my mother, laure meyer, occurring when i was not yet four years old, hollowed out within me an abyss of metaphysical nostalgia that was never to be filled."
